### 增加分类属性
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/attributes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "颜色类型11",
    "_type": "dynamic",
    "cid":84
}
r
### 根据分类id获取分类属性
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/attributes/?cid=65&_type=dynamic

### 根据属性ID获取分类属性
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/attribute/10/

### 根据属性ID更新分类属性
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/attribute/25/
Content-Type: application/json

{   
    "name":"型号",
    "val":"test222",
    "_type":"static"
}

### 根据属性ID删除分类属性
DELETE  http://127.0.0.1:5000/attribute/25/